<title>POLAND: Polifarb Wroclaw under water.</title>
<headline>Polifarb Wroclaw under water.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Factory buildings of the Polish paintmaker Polifarb Wroclaw SA were completely flooded on July 12 causing serious losses but their precise extent is impossible to estimate, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Since July 12 Polifarb Wroclaw SA has been completely flooded with water to a level...of between 0.8 to three meters... which entails serious losses,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Polifarb said the length of the production stoppage and extent of losses could not be estimated because it was impossible to get to factory buidings.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
